2:T4fc,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","@id":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/minecraft-backpack-patrick-stewart-style-voiceover#blogposting","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/minecraft-backpack-patrick-stewart-style-voiceover","headline":"Minecraft Backpack Patrick Stewart","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/minecraft-backpack-patrick-stewart-style-voiceover","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Guy Harris","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceoverguy","image":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-profile.jpg"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"VoiceoverGuy","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.png"}},"inLanguage":"en-GB","isAccessibleForFree":true,"description":"Guy Harris voices the Minecraft backpack promo with his trademark Patrick Stewart-style delivery. Witty, quirky, and perfect for parody narration.","datePublished":"2019-08-01T00:00:00+00:00","dateModified":"2019-08-01T00:00:00+00:00","keywords":["british game impression impersonation"],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/img/blog/minecraft-backpack-patrick-stewart-style-voiceover.jpg"}}3:T473,<h2>Voicing Another Minecraft Promo</h2>
<p>I was asked once again to lend my voice to a Minecraft campaign, this time, for a quirky backpack promo. As one of the biggest brands in gaming, Minecraft always brings big expectations, but the creative on this one hit all the right notes.</p>
<p>With a mock scientist angle and dry humour, it felt like the perfect moment to dust off the <a href="https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/patrick-stewart-money-supermartket-voice" title="Patrick Stewart MoneySuperMarket Voice" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Patrick Stewart-style voice</a>. The team at Mojang were chuffed, and so was I.</p>
<p>🧱 You might also like these other Minecraft projects I’ve voiced:</p>
<ul>
  <li><a href="https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/minecraft-handbook-voiceover" title="Minecraft Handbook Voice" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Minecraft Handbook – the first of the series</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/minecraft-combat-voiceover" title="Minecraft Combat Handbook Voice" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Combat Edition – an epic twist</a></li>
</ul>7:["slug","minecraft-backpack-patrick-stewart-style-voiceover","d"]
