-harris-voiceover.png\"}},\"inLanguage\":\"en-GB\",\"description\":\"Guy Harris voices the Minecraft backpack promo with his trademark Patrick Stewart-style delivery. Witty, quirky, and perfect for parody narration.\",\"uploadDate\":\"2019-08-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Minecraft Backpack Patrick Stewart"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Another chance to bring out my trusted Patrick Stewart-style voice. Minecraft + backpack + mock seriousness = a perfect recipe for parody narration.</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$3"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/GYR8m1aYAYs","title":"Minecraft Backpack Patrick Stewart","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/minecraft-backpack-patrick-stewart-style-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Minecraft Backpack Promo Voice – Patrick Stewart Style","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Why Minecraft Still Matters</h2>\r\n<p>Launched in 2009, Minecraft continues to dominate the sandbox gaming world, because if you can imagine it, you can build it. This promo was tied to a new merch drop, giving me a chance to mix fun with formality in the narration.</p>\r\n<p>If you're exploring Minecraft for the first time (or the fiftieth), check out the Minecraft official merch shop, or browse Mojang’s channels for more surprises.</p>\r\n<p>As long as they keep making scripts this good, I’ll happily keep voicing Minecraft videos!</p>"}}]]}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>More in This Voice Style</h2>\r\n<p>If you enjoyed this, don’t miss some of my other parodic or epic takes using the same delivery style:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/hide-the-corpse-promo-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Hide the Corpse – deadpan meets absurd</a></li>\r\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/nfl-cbs-sports-king-henry-voice-patrick-stewart\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CBS NFL King Henry – big drama, bigger voice</a></li>\r\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/lending-crowd-patrick-stewart-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Lending Crowd – formal meets friendly</a></li>\r\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">European Summit – polished and professional</a></li>\r\n</ul>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/character-voiceovers.jpg","alt":"Minecraft Backpack Promo Voice – Patrick Stewart Style","className":"blog-post-img"}]}]]}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>🎤 Ready to Add Gravitas to Your Campaign?</h2>\r\n<p>If you're working on a <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">TV ad</a>, explainer, or in-game promo and want a trusted voice with character, I’d love to help.</p>\r\n<p>Want more in this style? Try:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/lending-crowd-patrick-stewart-voiceover\" title=\"Lending Crowd Voice\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Lending Crowd</a></li>\r\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voiceover\" title=\"European Summit Voice\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">European Collaboration Summit</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>I’m happy to provide a quick sample from your script if you'd like to check the fit, <a href=\"mailto:guy@voiceoverguy.co.uk?subject=Minecraft%20Promo%20Voiceover%20Enquiry\">drop me an email</a> and let’s bring your idea to life.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L5",null,{"pageTitle":"Minecraft Backpack Patrick Stewart","pageUrl":"minecraft-backpack-patrick-stewart-style-voiceover"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L4","698",{"href":"/lifeless-game-trailer-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/lifeless-trailer-voice.jpg","alt":"Lifeless Game Trailer Voice","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Lifeless Game Trailer Voice"}]]}],["$","$L4","912",{"href":"/ideal-heating-soft-male-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/ideal-boilers-soft-male-voice.jpg","alt":"ideal-boilers-soft-male-voice","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Ideal Heating's Male Voiceover"}]]}],["$","$L4","536",{"href":"/spiderman-car-voiceover","class